# NOTE: do NOT add `.env` / `.env.*` / `*.env` here.  Emergent's
# deployment pipeline reads the committed `/app/backend/.env` and
# `/app/frontend/.env` files at deploy time — gitignoring them
# breaks production env propagation.  Real secrets must go through
# the platform's secrets UI, not into env files.
# (Lines that previously ignored .env files were removed 2026-06-27
# after the deployment agent flagged them as a blocker.)
