# NOTE: do NOT re-add `.env`, `**/.env`, `backend/.env`, `frontend/.env`,
# `.env.*`, or `*.env` here.  Those patterns cause Emergent's deploy
# pipeline (MANAGE_SECRETS → pull_source) to fail with "read env file
# backend/.env: no such file or directory", killing every deployment.
# Lines removed 2026-07-10 after Emergent Support's history-reset
# (commit 6bbc98e2) inadvertently wiped backend/.env & frontend/.env
# from the workspace, causing the backend to crash-loop on KeyError:
# MONGO_URL.  Restore from /app/backups/*.zip if this happens again.
